."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〇璃果さんの名前を入力する時、「りか」と打っても変換候補に「璃果」が出てこないのですが、璃果さんのオススメの入力方法はありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"瑠璃果実"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頭と後ろを消す！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〇敬語でコメント書いているのですが、タメ語の方が嬉しかったりしますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうですね、、、。\nどちらでも嬉しいです◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〇そう言えばロケ楽しかった？？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても楽しかったです☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〇マスカットと巨峰はどっちが好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悩ましい、、、。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マスカット！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はるなぴです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オススメのオムライス屋さんに\nいつか連れてってね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんにとって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な1日になりますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://imag